OL,3,GNEWSAViolence rises 'substantially' at
OL,4,Aprison - watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FRates of violence have risen
OL,7,F"substantially" in three years at HMP
OL,8,FGartree in Leicestershire, a watchdog
OL,9,Fhas found.
OL,11,FHM Inspectorate of Prisons made an
OL,12,Funannounced visit in August and found
OL,13,Frates of violence at the prison had
OL,14,Fincreased by 53%, and the number of
OL,15,Fassaults on staff had risen by 49%
OL,16,Fsince its last inspection in 2023.
OL,18,FInspectors also said rates of self-harm
OL,19,Fhad "doubled" - but remained below the
OL,20,Faverage for Category B training prisons
OL,21,F- and support for prisoners in crisis
OL,22,Fwas "too limited".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
