OL,3,GNEWSAViolence rises 'substantially' at
OL,4,Aprison - watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Justice (MoJ)
OL,7,Fspokesperson said the report, published
OL,8,Fon Monday, showed "signs of progress"
OL,9,Fand that the rate of serious assaults
OL,10,Fhad fallen by 20% in the prison.
